## 📖 Project Overview

This project is a simple Stock Portfolio Tracker developed in Python as part of the **CodeAlpha Python Programming Internship**. It allows users to enter stock symbols and quantities, calculates the total investment using predefined stock prices, and provides an option to save the portfolio summary as a text file.

---

## ✨ Features

- Add multiple stocks
- Hardcoded stock prices
- Calculates total investment
- Displays portfolio summary
- Saves report to a text file
- User-friendly console interface

---

## 🛠 Technologies Used

- Python 3
- Dictionary
- Functions
- Loops
- File Handling
- DateTime Module

